OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine on offer this evening
OL,7,Fleaving long clear spells across the
OL,8,Fcountry overnight. Under clear skies
OL,9,Ftemperatures will be allowed to
OL,10,Frapidly fall away, with a rural frost
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAnother chilly, bright start
OL,14,Fwith plenty of sunshine on Sunday.
OL,15,FSome patchy cloud through the
OL,16,Fafternoon may lead to a very isolated
OL,17,Flight shower. Temperatures around
OL,18,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
