OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FShowers move westwards across the
OL,7,Fcountry through Monday, clearing
OL,8,Flater. A dry interlude follows, before
OL,9,Fmore rain develops on Tuesday and
OL,10,FWednesday. Temperatures nearer
OL,11,Faverage, though possibly windy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
